  "body": "Positioned to capture sunshine, views and convenience, this brand-new residence presents an outstanding opportunity to secure a low-maintenance lifestyle in one of the Hibiscus Coast's most desirable locations.\r\n\r\nDesigned with modern living in mind, the home offers a seamless open-plan layout, with the kitchen, dining and living areas connecting effortlessly to an expansive outdoor deck. Elevated views provide the perfect backdrop for entertaining, unwinding or simply enjoying the peaceful outlook.\r\n\r\nWhat You'll Love About This Home:\r\n\r\n Brand-new home offering modern, low-maintenance living\r\n Light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining and living areas\r\n Seamless indoor-outdoor flow to an expansive entertaining deck\r\n Elevated views and a sunny position\r\n Master suite with direct access to the outdoor deck\r\n Two additional bedrooms and a second bathroom\r\n 10-Year Master Build Guarantee for added peace of mind\r\n Prominent corner site\r\n Short drive to Orewa Beach, cafés, restaurants and retail amenities\r\n Move-in ready, with nothing more to do\r\n\r\nThe thoughtful layout provides flexibility for a range of lifestyles, whether accommodating family and guests, creating a work-from-home space or simply enjoying the ease of modern living. The master suite offers a private retreat, with direct access to the deck further enhancing the home's connection with the outdoors.\r\n\r\nAdding further confidence is the 10-Year Master Build Guarantee, providing reassurance around the quality of construction and your investment for years to come.\r\n\r\nSet in a convenient Hibiscus Coast location, Orewa's beautiful beach, cafés, restaurants and everyday amenities are all just a short drive away.\r\n\r\nStylish, functional and completely move-in ready, this is an ideal opportunity for professionals, downsizers and first-home buyers looking to enjoy the comfort and convenience of modern coastal living.\r\n\r\nCall today to arrange a private viewing, or we look forward to welcoming you to one of our open homes.",
